      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Adult patients with sickle cell disease often report high pain intensity ratings during hospitalization. However, no evidence of upward titration in analgesics was found particularly during prolonged episodes. Development of algorithms to facilitate decisions regarding titration of medications is recommended."},
